Harper: Short checklist for SEO handoff before the webinar push tomorrow: keywords for hero + FAQ, immediate 301s for legacy promos, JSON-LD Event + FAQ, anchor text table, UTMs mapped to sales. Who volunteers?
Diego: I can own KWs + anchor table. Proposals: primary - 'production LLM serving', 'low-latency LLM inference'; supporting - 'inference batching', 'LLM caching strategies'. Hero H1: 'Production LLM Serving: Fast & Cost-Effective'.
Anika: I'll do redirects + canonical. Legacy routes: /promo/alpha and /events/edge23 -> 301 to /webinars/serving-llms. No meta-refresh.
Diego: Nginx snippet to include in infra PR:
```
location = /promo/alpha {
  return 301 /webinars/serving-llms;
}
location = /events/edge23 {
  return 301 /webinars/serving-llms;
}
```
Anika: Canonical guidance: landing -> self canonical tag + header; legacy -> 301. If we need archival, mark noindex only after QA.
utm-bot: UTM template: utm_source=marcom, utm_medium=email|social|partner, utm_campaign=webinar_serving_llms_jun26. Sales will map utm_campaign -> CRM field 'campaign_code'.
Harper: JSON-LD Event example for head (paste exact string into CMS):
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Redwood Inference Webinar: Serving LLMs","startDate":"2026-06-26T18:00:00Z","location":{"@type":"VirtualLocation","url":"https://redwood.ai/webinars/serving-llms"},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Redwood Inference"}}
Diego: FAQ longtails to add: 'how to reduce LLM inference cost', 'best practices for LLM batching'.
Harper: Action items: Diego -> upload KW + anchors to CMS; Anika -> open infra PR for redirects + canonical headers; utm-bot -> confirm UTM doc link. Need PR + CMS upload by EOD. Ping here when done. :thumbsup:
